### STORE TEST

### GET STORE
### GET ALL STORES
GET http://localhost:3000/api/store
### GET STORE BY ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/store/

### CREATE STORE
### CREATE WITHOUT TOKEN
POST http://localhost:3000/api/store
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Azizi Shop"
}
### UNAUTHORIZED CREATE
POST http://localhost:3000/api/store
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Azizi Shop",
    "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjE1LCJpYXQiOjE3OTUzMjY2MzYsImV4cCI6MTc5NTQxMzAzNn0.fz5Z9tTrNpw_1aUc5SeuPVOw8PYjozrgCvvZvRPoc3Q"
}
### AUTHORIZED CREATE BUT MISSING FIELDS
POST http://localhost:3000/api/store
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjE3LCJpYXQiOjE3OTUzMjY3MDcsImV4cCI6MTc5NTQxMzEwN30.suXsJ0riuHC6e3oFiXKEsCR6ovTSvJGTkFhh7eezySk"
}
